{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110501001:0":{"text":"다들 준비됐나요? 저 앞이 바로 첫 번째 관문인 “지식의 시련”입니다!","source_cn":"准备好了吗？前方就是“智之试炼”的第一个关口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91E9A70072FEBD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110501002:0":{"text":"경기 시작 전에 칼라가 한 가지 힌트를 드리죠! 지금 여러분은 서로 라이벌 관계이지만...","source_cn":"在比赛正式开始之前，曼卡拉有小小的提示！你们虽然是对手——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A398FBB74C5376A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110501003:0":{"text":"이번 시련은 “협력”해야만 더 빨리 승리를 쟁취할 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"但在这次的试炼中，可能“合作”才能更快取得胜利哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FCE0D6256C7ECA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110501004:0":{"text":"자, 힌트는 여기까지! 그럼, 경기를 시작하겠습니다!","source_cn":"提示到此为止！那么，比赛正式开始——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0834956A19DC6848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"칼라","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}